  // Windows execution history (the Prefetch folder): catches cheat tools that were closed before the launcher started.
  // Readable only when the launcher runs as administrator; otherwise it reports execution-history-unavailable (info).
  // Before enabling it, add a matching sentence to "disclosure" and bump "disclosureVersion" (e.g. iw-v3):
  // this is the program-run history of the player's machine. See "Execution history" in README.md.
  "executionHistory": {
